    "detailed_description": "Just like in the arcade! Storm's Harvest brings the spooky fun to your home!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStorm, the pumpkin-picking ghost, has until sunrise to collect his crops.<br />\r\nPick a high score but don't get picked-off! The beasts are also out to claim their prize!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWendy the Crow and Riptide the Rockodile want to steal your pumpkins for themselves.<br />\r\nCreepy Crawlers are making a mess of your pumpkin patches.<br />\r\nAnd those ROTTEN slimes are turning your pumpkins into Pumpkindas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeat the beasts and grab your gourds!",
